From 6ba5e0a44ccbce0650de52033eb08cb8236d5ec4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6797 internal experiment <nobody@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:48:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mediatek: probe MT6797 firmware beneath passive CONSYS
 owner

Populate the WLAN child only after the shared owner has bound its resources and confirmed CONN off.

Request and validate the retained image in the child, keeping execution gated.

Internal experiment with synthetic authorship. Not DCO-certified or ready for upstream submission.
---
